            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart's Prodigy</strong><br>\nWolfgang Amadeus Mozart was a musical prodigy who was composing by the age of five. Born in Salzburg, Austria, in 1756, he was the son of Leopold Mozart, a musician and notable composer. Mozart's early exposure to music through his father's tutelage led to an early recognition of his talent. By the age of six, he was performing for European royalty, astounding audiences with his skill.</p>\n\n<p><strong>The Traveling Virtuoso</strong><br>\nMozart spent much of his childhood on tour with his family, performing across Europe. These tours were educational experiences that exposed him to a wide range of musical styles and traditions. They also helped to establish his reputation as an exceptional keyboard player and composer. During these years, he visited major cultural centers such as Munich, Paris, London, and Rome, absorbing influences that would later emerge in his music.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Mozart's Time in Vienna</strong><br>\nIn 1781, Mozart settled in Vienna, the cultural hub of the era, becoming a freelance performer and composer. This was a daring move, as musicians typically relied on court appointments for stability. In Vienna, he achieved fame but also faced financial difficulties, in part due to his lavish lifestyle. Despite this, Vienna was where Mozart produced many of his best-known works, including operas, symphonies, and piano concertos.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
